<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>Translation Delayed</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
        .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
        .header { background: #ffc107; color: #333; padding: 20px; text-align: center; }
        .content { padding: 20px; background: #f8f9fa; }
        .notice { background: #fff3cd; border: 1px solid #ffeaa7; padding: 15px; margin: 20px 0; border-radius: 5px; }
        .footer { text-align: center; padding: 20px; color: #666; font-size: 12px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>⏰ Translation Delayed</h1>
        </div>
        
        <div class="content">
            <h2>Delay Notice</h2>
            
            <div class="notice">
                <strong>📋 NOTICE:</strong> Your translation request deadline has been missed.
            </div>
            
            <h3>Request Details:</h3>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Request ID:</strong> {{request.id}}</li>
                <li><strong>Description:</strong> {{request.description}}</li>
                <li><strong>Deadline:</strong> {{request.deadline}}</li>
                <li><strong>Current Progress:</strong> {{percentage}}%</li>
            </ul>
            
            <p><strong>Current Status:</strong> The translator has missed the deadline and has 3 days to request an extension.</p>
            
            <p><strong>What Happens Next:</strong></p>
            <ul>
                <li>The translator will be notified about the missed deadline</li>
                <li>They have 3 days to request an extension</li>
                <li>If no extension is requested, the request will be marked as failed</li>
                <li>Your deposit will be refunded if the request fails</li>
            </ul>
            
            <p>You will be notified of any extension requests or if the request is marked as failed.</p>
            
            <p>We apologize for the inconvenience and appreciate your patience.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="footer">
            <p>This is an automated message from HereToTranslate</p>
            <p>Please do not reply to this email</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
